{{PAGENAME}} is a piece of early leg [[:Category:Armor|armor]]. It gives some Melee bonus, making it more valuable than leather pants. It equips to the [[Equipment Screen|equipment slot]] 10R.

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{{_{q}Finebone + _{q}Bone Material + _{q}Hide Strap + _{q}Bone Glue} + _{q}Leather}{5}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Carpentry}</math>.

